// manifest_media_c2_default.xml prebuilt removed: it was a stale vintf-only
// declaration extracted from stock, where the MTK c2 binary implements the
// /default instance. On lineage no binary implements it, so this manifest
// was causing mediaserver to hang forever in getService() → bootloop cascade.
// The AOSP stub android.hardware.media.c2-default-service now provides both
// the binary AND an identical vintf_fragment, so this prebuilt is redundant.

